  "fullDescription": "Embrace the timeless charm of nature with this exquisite set of ten digital papers featuring a delicate pressed flowers art style. Each design showcases vibrant, dried botanical arrangements in rich shades of terracotta, cornflower blue, and dusty rose, set against a warm, rustic cream-textured background. These high-resolution 300 DPI images capture the fine details of petals and stems, offering a vintage and organic feel that adds a touch of cottagecore elegance to any project. While these papers are a dream for creating nostalgic junk journaling spreads and heritage scrapbooks, their versatile use makes them an ideal choice for crafting heartfelt sympathy cards, botanical event stationery, or even garden-themed art displays.\n\nBeyond traditional paper crafts, these high-quality backgrounds are perfect for digital planning layouts, social media story templates, and peaceful web backgrounds that require a handcrafted look. You can utilize these floral borders for a wide variety of print-on-demand products like custom phone cases, aesthetic notebook covers, and elegant wall art. They are also perfectly suited for physical DIY projects such as decoupage on vintage tins, handmade gift tags, and intricate mixed-media collage work. Whether you are preserving family memories or designing a botanical-inspired digital space, these pressed flower landscapes provide a graceful and timeless foundation for your next masterpiece.",
